        <definition>const bool llvm::LoopFullUnrollPass::OnlyWhenForced</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>OnlyWhenForced</name>
        <qualifiedname>llvm::LoopFullUnrollPass::OnlyWhenForced</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>If false, use a cost model to determine whether unrolling of a loop is profitable. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If true, only loops that explicitly request unrolling via metadata are considered. All other loops are skipped. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
