        <definition>const bool llvm::LoopFullUnrollPass::ForgetSCEV</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>ForgetSCEV</name>
        <qualifiedname>llvm::LoopFullUnrollPass::ForgetSCEV</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>If true, forget all loops when unrolling. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If false, forget top-most loop of the currently processed loops, which removes one entry at a time from the internal <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_s_c_e_v" kindref="compound">SCEV</ref> records. For large loops, the former is faster. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
